ed effects of molecular complexity and hydrogen-bonding capacity.\ndf['Interaction_SpMax_L_nHDon'] = df['SpMax_L'] * df['nHDon']", "# LOC_per_bin_C_O_ratio_category\n# Ratio of the lopping centric index to the binned C_O_ratio category.\n# Usefulness: Encapsulates the contribution of structure relative to categorical distinctions in carbon-oxygen ratios.\ndf['LOC_per_bin_C_O_ratio_category'] = df['LOC'] / (df['bin_C_O_ratio_category'] + 1)", "# exp_Interaction_LOC_nHDon_plus_nO\n# Exponential transformation of the interaction term between LOC and nHDon_plus_nO.\n# Usefulness: Explores exponential growth effects in relational trends between topology and bond interactions.\ndf['exp_Interaction_LOC_nHDon_plus_nO'] = np.exp(df['Interaction_LOC_nHDon_plus_nO'])", "df.drop(columns=['sqrt_C_O_ratio'], inplace=True)", "df.drop(columns=['log_SdO_plus_1_div_LOC'], inplace=True)", "df.drop(columns=['sigmoid_Psi_i_1d'], inplace=True)"]
